{"book":"proverbs","num":22,"verses":[{"en":"A good name is rather to be chosen than great riches, and loving favour rather than silver and gold.","n":1,"sm":"Ia sili le manao ina ia 2 ta‘uleleia i le manao i le oloa e tele; ma le agalelei, ia sili le manao i lea i le ario ma le auro.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ia"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manao"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"2"},{"en":"","sm":"ta‘uleleia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manao"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oloa"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tele;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"agalelei,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manao"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ario"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auro."}]},{"en":"The rich and poor meet together: the LORD is the maker of them all.","n":2,"sm":"O le mauoa ma le mativa la te fetaiai; na faia i laua uma e le ALI.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mauoa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mativa"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"fetaiai;"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"laua"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALI."}]},{"en":"A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself: but the simple pass on, and are punished.","n":3,"sm":"O le ua faautauta, na te iloa atu le leaga, ma lafi ai; a o e ua faigofie, e o atu pea i latou, ona faasalaina ai lea.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faautauta,"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"lafi"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm"