em within thee; they shall withal be fitted in thy lips.","n":18,"sm":"Aua e matagofie pe afai e te tausia ai i lou loto; e faatatauina faatasi i ou laugutu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"matagofie"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"tausia"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"loto;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faatatauina"},{"en":"","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"laugutu."}]},{"en":"That thy trust may be in the LORD, I have made known to thee this day, even to thee.","n":19,"sm":"Ua ou aʻoaʻo ia te oe, o oe lava, i le aso nei, ina ia fai le ALII mou faatuatuaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻoaʻo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"lava,"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"nei,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"mou"},{"en":"","sm":"faatuatuaga."}]},{"en":"Have not I written to thee excellent things in counsels and knowledge,","n":20,"sm":"Ua ou le tusi atu ea ia te oe o mea sili i faatonuga ma le poto;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tusi"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"faatonuga"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto;"}]},{"en":"That I might make thee know the certainty of the words of truth; that thou mightest answer the words of truth to them that send unto thee?","n":21,"sm":"ina ia ou faailoa ia te oe le faamaoni o upu moni; ina ia e tali atu ai upu toni i e aau mai ai nisi ia te oe?","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaoni"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"moni;"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tali"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"toni"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aau"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"nisi"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe?"}]},{"en":"Rob not the poor, because he is poor: neither oppress the afflicted in the gate:","n":22,"sm":"Aua e te faoa mea a le tagata mativa, ina ua mativa o ia; aua foi e te faasaua i le faitotoa le ua tiga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faoa"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"mativa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mativa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faasaua"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faitotoa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tiga."}]},{"en":"For the LORD will plead their cause, and spoil the soul of those that spoiled them.","n":23,"sm":"Aua o le ALII, o ia na te faia la latou finauga; na te fasiotia foi i latou o e faasaua ia i latou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"finauga;"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"fasiotia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faasaua"},{"en":"","sm":"i